padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>C</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>46</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>136</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>44</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"81\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the largest angle, its opposite side <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 1.51em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> must be the longest side of the triangle. </p>\n<p>Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"83\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the smallest angle, its opposite side <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"84\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 1.519em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the shortest side of the triangle.</p>\n<p>So, we have</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"85\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nand therefore, the required order is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"86\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 1.519em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mover space=\"2\"><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 1.509em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mover space=\"2\"><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 1.51em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  </p>\n</div></div>",
